\item[S2] John Milnor, ``Problems on local connectivity'', in Ben Bielefeld and Mikhail Lyubich (eds.), Problems in Holomorphic Dynamics (1992), Problem 13, pp. 23; arXiv:math/9205209v1. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/9205209}.
